.TH MX-NETWORK-ASSISTANT 1 "August 2026" "mx-network-assistant 26.03" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-network-assistant \- network configuration and troubleshooting tool for MX Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-network-assistant
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-network-assistant
is a graphical tool for configuring and troubleshooting network connections
in MX Linux, including wired, wireless, and driver-related (e.g. Ndiswrapper,
Broadcom) settings.
.PP
Operations requiring administrative privileges are performed through a
PolicyKit-protected helper.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/libexec/mx-network-assistant/helper
Privileged helper used for system network changes.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.mxlinux.pkexec.mxna-helper.policy
PolicyKit policy for the privileged helper.
.SH AUTHORS
.B mx-network-assistant
is maintained by the MX Linux project.
